<title>USA: TABLE-Alliance Capital Q2 oper net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Alliance Capital Q2 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>ALLIANCE CAPITAL MANAGEMENT LP</p>
<p>	   SUMMARY CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>(unaudited, in thousands except per Unit amounts)</p>
<p>					     Q2		 Six Months</p>
<p>				     1997     1996	1997     1996</p>
<p>Revenues			225,336  196,149   444,587  377,765</p>
<p> Nonrecurring charge	120,900	---   120,900	---</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	 (64,122)   47,030  (10,773)   92,097</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per Unit</p>
<p>				   (0.74)     0.55    (0.12)     1.09</p>
<p>Net income before</p>
<p>  nonrecurring charge	56,778   47,030   110,127   92,097</p>
<p>Net income per Unit before</p>
<p> nonrecurring charge	   0.66     0.55	1.28     1.09</p>
<p>Weighted average Units</p>
<p>  outstanding		  85,422   84,702    85,444   83,905</p>
<p>NOTE: Alliance incurred a nonrecurring noncash charge of $121 million, or $1.40 per unit, during the second quarter of 1997 in connection with the write-down of the recorded value of goodwill and contracts associated with Cursitor Holdings LP and Cursitor Holdings Ltd acquired in 1996.</p>
